# archives — nothing in this repo should be a zip. public/images/products.zip
# (17 MB) and public/videos.zip (210 MB) were both dropped into public/ by
# accident, which meant they were being served to visitors. GitHub rejects any
# single file over 100 MB outright, so the videos zip could never have been
# pushed at all. Both are parked in source-assets/ locally.
*.zip

# unreferenced draft footage, ~187 MB across six files. Only
# public/videos/himalayan-new-hero.mp4 is used (HeroVideo.tsx) and it is already
# tracked. These are Firefly generations kept for review; committing them would
# bloat every future clone for footage the site never loads. Delete them, or
# force-add with `git add -f` if a specific one is genuinely wanted.
public/videos/Firefly*.mp4
